==Afrikaans==

===Etymology===
From a merger of {{inh|af|nl|leggen||to lay}} and {{m|nl|liggen||to lie}}. Formally, the forms with ''-ê-'' are from {{m|nl||leggen}}, while the alternative present participle is from {{m|nl||liggen}} (as is the lexicalised past participle {{m|af|geleë}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/lɛː/|lang=af}}

===Verb===
{{af-verb|pres2=liggende}}

# {{lb|af|intransitive}} to {{l|en|lie}} {{gloss|to be in a horizontal position}}
#: {{ux|af|Hy '''lê''' op die bed.|He's '''lying''' on the bed.}}
# {{lb|af|transitive}} to {{l|en|lay}} {{gloss|to put into a horizontal position}}
#: {{ux|af|Hy '''lê''' sy tas op die bed.|He '''lays''' his bag on the bed.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to lay}} {{l|af|neerlê}} {{i|more common}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|af|geleë}}

